private function collect(string $table):array{return match($table){'sites'=>['host'=>trim((string)($_POST['host']??'')),'slug'=>trim((string)($_POST['slug']??'')),'name'=>trim((string)($_POST['name']??'')),'lang'=>substr(trim((string)($_POST['lang']??'sk')),0,2),'theme_id'=>(int)($_POST['theme_id']??0)?:null,'is_active'=>isset($_POST['is_active'])?1:0],'pages'=>['site_id'=>(int)($_POST['site_id']??0),'parent_id'=>(int)($_POST['parent_id']??0)?:null,'slug'=>trim((string)($_POST['slug']??'')),'title'=>trim((string)($_POST['title']??'')),'template'=>in_array($_POST['template']??'',['home','vizitka','text','contact'])?$_POST['template']:'text','meta_description'=>trim((string)($_POST['meta_description']??'')),'status'=>($_POST['status']??'')==='published'?'published':'draft','position'=>(int)($_POST['position']??0),'show_in_menu'=>isset($_POST['show_in_menu'])?1:0],'menu_items'=>['site_id'=>(int)($_POST['site_id']??0),'parent_id'=>(int)($_POST['parent_id']??0)?:null,'label'=>trim((string)($_POST['label']??'')),'page_id'=>(int)($_POST['page_id']??0)?:null,'url'=>trim((string)($_POST['url']??''))?:null,'target'=>($_POST['target']??'')==='_blank'?'_blank':'_self','aria_label'=>trim((string)($_POST['aria_label']??''))?:null,'sort_order'=>(int)($_POST['sort_order']??0),'is_active'=>isset($_POST['is_active'])?1:0],'themes'=>['name'=>trim((string)($_POST['name']??'')),'tokens'=>(string)($_POST['tokens']??'{}')],default=>[]};}
